   "subject": "how to fix the Error in scan1snps",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div>    I have been conducting qtl analysis. When it came to &quot;scan1snps&quot;, it showed the error:</div><div>  <span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\">  Error in scan1snps(pr, cc$pmap, cc$pheno, k[[&quot;1&quot;]], sex, query_func = query_variants,  : </span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\">  genoprobs and map have different numbers of markers</span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">   Is anyone know how to fix it?</span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">   Thanks!</span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">               Chenhan</span></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "xE3QuZSJAQAJ",
   "from": "Karl Broman",
   "author": "96353e7106735838",
   "date": "2019-05-09T22:11:03Z",
   "subject": "Re: how to fix the Error in scan1snps",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>It&#39;s hard to tell for sure without seeing more of the context. <br></div><div><br></div><div>How was <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">pr</span> created? Had you used <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">insert_pseudomarkers()</span>? If so, you need to use that map. Somehow <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">pr</span> is a different size from <span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">cc$pmap</span>.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">  sapply(pr, dim)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace\">  sapply(cc$pmap, length)</span></div><div><br></div><div>karl<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>On Thursday, May 9, 2019 at 4:10:21 PM UTC-5, Chenhan Zhong wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div>    I have been conducting qtl analysis. When it came to &quot;scan1snps&quot;, it showed the error:</div><div>  <span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\">  Error in scan1snps(pr, cc$pmap, cc$pheno, k[[&quot;1&quot;]], sex, query_func = query_variants,  : </span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\">  genoprobs and map have different numbers of markers</span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">   Is anyone know how to fix it?</span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">   Thanks!</span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">               Chenhan</span></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "fqmBpAx8AQAJ",
   "from": "Chenhan Zhong",
   "author": "d3c445ee99455fe8",
   "date": "2019-05-09T22:19:18Z",
   "subject": "Re: [Rqtl2-disc] Re: how to fix the Error in scan1snps",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Here is my script.<div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">library(qtl2)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(196,26,22)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">message(</span>&quot;Write control file&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(196,26,22)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">write_control_file(</span>&quot;~/RStudio/RawData/cc/cc.json&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">, crosstype = </span>&quot;risib8&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>geno_file=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;cc_geno.csv&quot;</span>,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>founder_geno_file=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;MMnGM_foundergeno.csv&quot;</span>,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>pheno_file=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;cc_pheno3.csv&quot;</span>,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>pheno_transposed=FALSE,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>gmap_file=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;MMnGM_gmap.csv&quot;</span>,<span> </span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>pmap_file=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;MMnGM_pmap.csv&quot;</span>,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>crossinfo_file=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;cc_crossinfo.csv&quot;</span>,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>covar_file=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;cc_covar.csv&quot;</span>,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>sex_covar=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;Sex&quot;</span>,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>sex_codes=list(male=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;male&quot;</span>,female=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;female&quot;</span>),</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>xchr=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;X&quot;</span>,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>geno_codes=c(<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;A&quot;</span>=<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;B&quot;</span>=<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">3</span>),</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>alleles=LETTERS[<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span>:<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">8</span>],</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>geno_transposed=TRUE,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>founder_geno_transposed=TRUE,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(196,26,22)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span>                   </span>description=paste(</span>&quot;Data for Collaborative Cross (CC) lines&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">,</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                                     </span><span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;combine with memory data&quot;</span>),</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                   </span>overwrite=TRUE)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"># create zip file</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(196,26,22)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">message(</span>&quot;Create zip file&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">zip_datafiles(<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;~/RStudio/RawData/cc/cc.json&quot;</span>, overwrite=TRUE)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"># read data</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(196,26,22)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">cc &lt;- read_cross2(</span>&quot;~/RStudio/RawData/cc/cc.zip&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"># Calculating a kinship matrix</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"># Calculating genotype propabilities</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">map &lt;- insert_pseudomarkers(cc$gmap, step=<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span>)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"># use calc_genoprob() to calculate the QTL genotype probabilities.</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">pr &lt;- calc_genoprob(cc, map, error_prob=<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">0.002</span>)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"># convert genotype<span>  </span>probabilities to allele probabilities</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">apr &lt;- genoprob_to_alleleprob(pr)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"># Calculating a kinship matrix</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">kinship &lt;- calc_kinship(pr)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"># H-K regression</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">out &lt;- scan1(pr, cc$pheno)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"># plot the LOD curves</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">par(mar=c(<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">5.1</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">4.1</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1.1</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1.1</span>))</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">ymx &lt;- maxlod(out) </span><i># overall maximum LOD score</i></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">plot(out, map, lodcolumn=<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span>, col=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;slateblue&quot;</span>, ylim=c(<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">0</span>, ymx*<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1.02</span>))</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">legend(<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;topleft&quot;</span>, lwd=<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span>, col=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;slateblue&quot;</span>, colnames(out), bg=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;gray90&quot;</span>)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">#SNP association</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span> </span></span><i># using loco method</i></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">k &lt;- calc_kinship(apr, <span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;loco&quot;</span>)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span> </span></span><i>#create a numeric covariate for sex</i></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">sex &lt;- (cc$covar$Sex == <span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;male&quot;</span>)*<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">names(sex) &lt;- rownames(cc$covar)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span> </span></span><i>#strong peak on chr1_look for qtl effects</i></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">coef_c2 &lt;- scan1coef(apr[,<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;1&quot;</span>], cc$pheno, k[[<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;1&quot;</span>]], sex)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">par(mar=c(<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">4.1</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">4.1</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">0.6</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">0.6</span>))</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">plot_coefCC(coef_c2, cc$gmap[<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;1&quot;</span>], bgcolor=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;gray95&quot;</span>, legend=<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;bottomleft&quot;</span>)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"># create a function for querying the CC variants, call create_variant_query_func() with the path to the cc_variants.sqlite file:</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">query_variants &lt;- create_variant_query_func(<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;~/RStudio/RawData/CCdb/cc_variants.sqlite&quot;</span>)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"># grab the variants in the interval 17-18 Mbp on chromosome 1</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">variants_<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span>_<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">17.5</span> &lt;- query_variants(<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">17</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">18</span>)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"># create a function for querying the MGI mouse gene annotations</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(196,26,22)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">query_genes &lt;- create_gene_query_func(</span>&quot;~/RStudio/RawData/CCdb/mouse_genes_mgi.sqlite&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\">)</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"># grab the genes overlapping the interval 17-18 Mbp on chromosome 1</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">genes_<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span>_<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">17.5</span> &lt;- query_genes(<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">17</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">18</span>)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Helvetica;min-height:14px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><br></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(83,101,121)\"><i style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">##SNP associations</i></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">peak_Mbp &lt;- max(out, cc$pmap)$pos</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">variants &lt;- query_variants(<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span>, peak_Mbp - <span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span>, peak_Mbp + <span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span>)</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">out_snps &lt;- scan1snps(pr, cc$pmap, cc$pheno, k[[<span style=\"color:rgb(196,26,22)\">&quot;1&quot;</span>]], sex, query_func=query_variants,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><span>                      </span>chr=<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">1</span>, start=peak_Mbp<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">-1</span>, end=peak_Mbp<span style=\"color:rgb(28,0,207)\">+1</span>, keep_all_snps=TRUE)</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(243,243,243)\">ERROR happens here.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Thanks!</p><p style=\"margin:0px;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:12px;line-height:normal;font-family:Menlo;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">         Chenhan</p></div></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Thu, May 9, 2019 at 3:11 PM Karl Broman &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">kbr...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>It&#39;s hard to tell for sure without seeing more of the context. <br></div><div><br></div><div>How was <span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">pr</span> created? Had you used <span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">insert_pseudomarkers()</span>? If so, you need to use that map. Somehow <span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">pr</span> is a different size from <span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">cc$pmap</span>.</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">  sapply(pr, dim)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">  sapply(cc$pmap, length)</span></div><div><br></div><div>karl<br></div><br>On Thursday, May 9, 2019 at 4:10:21 PM UTC-5, Chenhan Zhong wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div>    I have been conducting qtl analysis. When it came to &quot;scan1snps&quot;, it showed the error:</div><div>  <span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\">  Error in scan1snps(pr, cc$pmap, cc$pheno, k[[&quot;1&quot;]], sex, query_func = query_variants,  : </span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(204,204,204)\">  genoprobs and map have different numbers of markers</span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">   Is anyone know how to fix it?</span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">   Thanks!</span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">               Chenhan</span></div></div></blockquote></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;R/qtl2 discussion&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rqtl2-disc+...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rqtl2...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/rqtl2-disc/eb8a3042-3dda-4d34-9e40-cd16f17e9047%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/rqtl2-disc/eb8a3042-3dda-4d34-9e40-cd16f17e9047%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483922790000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Jk5Nmiz3RushoXzHSobsD\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/rqtl2-disc/eb8a3042-3dda-4d34-9e40-cd16f17e9047%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nFor more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792483922790000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3F09D7CbiNdPRQtnfdG_-G\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
